wine (11.19.0-2cd) trixie; urgency=medium

  * debian/patches/0012-uxtheme-theme-font-system-dpi.patch: above 96
    DPI size theme fonts for the system DPI when GetThemeFont is called
    without a DC, and convert the point size of the theme's non-client
    fonts to pixels.
  * debian/patches/0013-uxtheme-negative-int.patch: keep the sign of
    negative theme integers.
  * debian/patches/0014-uxtheme-dpi-glyphs.patch: scale image glyphs to
    the DPI when the part sets TrueSizeScalingType = Dpi, as true-size
    images are, and enlarge images made for a lower DPI by pixel
    replication when the factor is a whole number.
  * debian/patches/0015-win32u-menu-arrow-dpi.patch: draw the submenu
    arrow at the DPI.
  * debian/patches/0016-win32u-minimized-width-dpi.patch: scale
    SM_CXMINIMIZED to the DPI.
  * debian/patches/0017-user32-icon-scaling.patch: above 96 DPI, when an
    icon has no entry of the requested size, prefer a larger one and
    scale it with filtering.
  * debian/patches/0018-comctl32-toolbar-metrics-dpi.patch: scale the
    toolbar separator width, default padding, list button padding and
    drop-down arrow to the DPI.
  * debian/patches/0019-comctl32-toolbar-std-bitmaps-dpi.patch: enlarge
    the standard toolbar bitmaps by a whole factor (1 at 120 DPI, 2 at
    144 and 192 DPI), fit application images in the same toolbar into
    the larger cells, take TB_SETBITMAPSIZE with their 16 or 24 pixel
    size as a request for the enlarged size, and report TBBF_LARGE from
    TB_GETBITMAPFLAGS, which asked a NULL DC and never did.
  * debian/patches/0020-comctl32-controls-dpi.patch: scale fixed pixel
    sizes of the up-down, date and time picker, header, pager, rebar,
    tab, tooltip, track bar and tree view controls to the DPI.
  * debian/patches/0021-edit-caret-dpi.patch: scale the caret width of
    the comctl32 and user32 edit controls to the DPI.
  * debian/patches/0022-comdlg32-fontdlg-dpi.patch: enlarge the font
    dialog images by the same whole factor and scale its colour swatch.
  * debian/patches/0023-riched20-default-font-dpi.patch: keep the point
    size of the rich edit default font at any DPI.
  * debian/patches/0024-winex11-title-icon-size.patch: add the X11
    Driver option TitleIconSize, which exports a window icon of the size
    the window manager draws in the title bar.
  * debian/patches/0025-winex11-cursor-dpi.patch: enlarge application
    cursors by a whole factor, to match the Xcursor theme cursors.
  * debian/patches/0026-taskmgr-dpi.patch: scale the Task Manager pages,
    status bar, columns and graphs to the DPI.

